<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Glaxo Wellcome started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Glaxo Wellcome started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Glaxo Wellcome Plc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said Glaxo Wellcome will become a &quot;champion of the international pharmaceuticals industry&quot; due to its strong product pipeline and ability to exploit strong research and development and marketing capabilities.</p>
<p>-- said believes company is about to launch its next phase of growth.</p>
</text>
